INSERT INTO lyrics (lyric_id, track_id, kind, source, synced_lyrics, plain_lyrics) VALUES (1753, 891, 'approved', 'lrclib', '[00:19.23] I think I''m losing my mind
[00:52.05] Blasting forward through a filamentous sky
[00:55.74] Beckoned by the flash of exploding light
[00:58.92] My soul crosses over the Great Divide
[01:02.67] Charging the void
[01:05.38] Isolated, I''ve been redeployed
[01:07.86] A rider on the crest
[01:10.30] Carry forth or plummet to death
[01:13.17] Autopilot function has been overridden
[01:16.56] For Isolation subjects, choice has been forbidden
[01:20.38] But death and destruction are what I''ve been given
[01:26.64] Charging the void
[01:28.92] Isolated, I''ve been redeployed
[01:31.33] A rider on the crest
[01:33.78] Carry forth or plummet to death
[02:10.17] Particles known only in theory, within my grasp
[02:15.15] Entering the cloud of the exploded mass
[03:00.47] To live is to die, disjunction seals our fate
[03:05.25] So many tyrants lie, pleading at the gates
[03:10.55] Regimes at an end with policies left to amend
[03:15.01] Where would the future lie if regimes had time to bide
[03:19.97] So bring unto me, morbid mastery
[03:24.61] I shall revoke the throne atop the stellar tree
[03:29.57] I choose a different path from those now dead in the mire
[03:34.03] They could not wield the flame of life. To which, now I conspire
[03:41.68] I charge the void
[03:43.92] I''ve found the purpose
[03:46.35] Immortalize this life
[03:48.72] I will return to the surface
[03:51.02] A lust for control and power
[03:53.47] Has grown in isolation
[03:55.86] A sky that once brought hope and light
[03:58.25] Now brings me desolation
[04:00.82] I must wield the sands of time to reclaim what is mine
[04:25.88] Stargazers have made the claims
[04:30.12] Of enocules bursting from Alshain
[04:35.29] Deep within the serpent''s spire
[04:39.83] I forge a path that takes me higher
[06:01.42] I''ve crossed the Great Divide
[06:03.77] Now I peer into the depths of death''s door
[06:07.10] Through the rippling veil I acquire
[06:09.30] The dust of life that Cygnus obscures
[06:11.71] To the other side, I have done it
[06:14.02] I now command the draw of death''s door
[06:16.42] To the relic Alshain, now I''ve got it
[06:18.81] A molecule like nothing before
[06:40.19] Star fields of Aquila set ablaze
[06:44.96] Reap the ashes of the great Alshain
[06:49.56] Relic Alshain
[06:52.04] Oh Shahin-i-tarazu, now my flesh is born anew
[07:09.31] Within my hands, I hold the sands
[07:14.07] A sky of pillars gives life and land
[07:18.61] The blackest night unveiling death
[07:23.42] One inhaling, exhaling breath
[07:28.04] Of the swan with blackened wings outstretched
[07:33.14] A path unseen unfolds for me
[07:37.71] I charge the void and ascend the tree
[07:42.56] To the bird of morbid mastery
[07:47.79] I heed the Cygnus call
[07:52.43] They will want the dust obtained through my gall
[07:57.56] I bring the gift of extended life
[08:02.25] No longer will control be born of strife
[08:06.99] I burn through disregarded space
[08:11.73] Dispatched, forgotten, now I stake my independent claim
[08:18.76] I will rule this stark domain
[08:25.77] ', 'I think I''m losing my mind
Blasting forward through a filamentous sky
Beckoned by the flash of exploding light
My soul crosses over the Great Divide

Charging the void
Isolated, I''ve been redeployed
A rider on the crest
Carry forth or plummet to death

Autopilot function has been overridden
For Isolation subjects, choice has been forbidden
But death and destruction are what I''ve been given

Charging the void
Isolated, I''ve been redeployed
A rider on the crest
Carry forth or plummet to death

Particles known only in theory, within my grasp
Entering the cloud of the exploded mass

To live is to die, disjunction seals our fate
So many tyrants lie, pleading at the gates
Regimes at an end with policies left to amend
Where would the future lie if regimes had time to bide
So bring unto me, morbid mastery
I shall revoke the throne atop the stellar tree
I choose a different path from those now dead in the mire
They could not wield the flame of life. To which, now I conspire

I charge the void
I''ve found the purpose
Immortalize this life
I will return to the surface
A lust for control and power
Has grown in isolation
A sky that once brought hope and light
Now brings me desolation
I must wield the sands of time to reclaim what is mine

Stargazers have made the claims
Of enocules bursting from Alshain
Deep within the serpent''s spire
I forge a path that takes me higher

I''ve crossed the Great Divide
Now I peer into the depths of death''s door
